    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While wearing this pack, you can take a Magic action to fire up its jets, which stay active for 1 hour or until you shut them off as a Magic action. The jets give you a Fly Speed of 60 feet. If you are aloft when the jets stop, you fall. Once the jets stop, you can’t use them again for 1d12 hours.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-vqAWdzWOhrdfrzBe\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Fire Up the Jets</em> applique la Vitesse de vol (1 heure), dépense l’utilisation et lance le 1d12 heures d’attente : rendez-la à la main une fois ce délai écoulé.</p></section>",
